Package: DeclareDesignZero
Type: Package
Title: A Tidyverse-First Research Design Declaration and Diagnosis Tool
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(person("Alex", "Coppock", email = "acoppock@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A ground-up rewrite of DeclareDesign built on tidyverse conventions.
    Declares, simulates, and diagnoses research designs with an API identical
    to DeclareDesign, using purrr for simulation, dplyr for diagnosis, and
    rlang for tidy evaluation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    broom,
    dplyr,
    fabricatr,
    generics,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyr
Suggests:
